<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="CRC Diagram V3" name="CRC Diagram V3"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1780" pageHeight="784" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;Team 6 CRC Diagram V3 (MVP)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CSCI 187 Group 6: Darren Hu, Henry Packer, Keaan Mirchandani, William Tran-Nguyen" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="800" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="Frontend (TypeScript, React)" style="rounded=1;dashed=1;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#555555;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="75" width="1280" height="679" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="Backend (C++)" style="rounded=1;dashed=1;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#555555;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1330" y="75" width="420" height="679" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center;padding:5px;border-bottom:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;courseLookup&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;&quot;&gt;src/courseLookup.ts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-right:1px solid #333;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Collaborators&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;width:68%;border-right:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;• Search courses by code, title or description&lt;br&gt;• Find the requirements a course counts toward&lt;br&gt;• Find the courses that list a course as a prerequisite&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;&quot;&gt;Course&lt;br&gt;DegreeRequirement&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="380" height="176" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center;padding:5px;border-bottom:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PlanProvider&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;&quot;&gt;src/components/PlanProvider.tsx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-right:1px solid #333;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Collaborators&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;width:68%;border-right:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;• Share the plan being edited with every page&lt;br&gt;• Keep unsaved edits as a draft until the student clicks &amp;quot;Save plan&amp;quot;&lt;br&gt;• Warn before leaving the page with unsaved changes&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;&quot;&gt;DegreePlan&lt;br&gt;API client (through TanStack Query)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="110" width="380" height="192" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center;padding:5px;border-bottom:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;API client&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;&quot;&gt;src/api.ts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-right:1px solid #333;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Collaborators&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;width:68%;border-right:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;• Load courses, requirements and the saved plan from the backend&lt;br&gt;• Save the whole plan&lt;br&gt;• Turn server errors into readable messages&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;&quot;&gt;Course&lt;br&gt;DegreeRequirement&lt;br&gt;DegreePlan&lt;br&gt;Routes (over HTTP)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="110" width="380" height="176" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center;padding:5px;border-bottom:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Routes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;&quot;&gt;server/src/Routes.cpp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-right:1px solid #333;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Collaborators&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;width:68%;border-right:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;• Serve GET /api/courses and /api/requirements&lt;br&gt;• Serve GET and PUT /api/plans/:planId&lt;br&gt;• Return 400 for a bad request body and 404 for a plan never saved&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;&quot;&gt;Database&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1350" y="110" width="380" height="192" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center;padding:5px;border-bottom:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;DegreePlan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;&quot;&gt;src/DegreePlan.ts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-right:1px solid #333;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Collaborators&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;width:68%;border-right:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;• Know the courses in each of the 12 quarters and which are completed&lt;br&gt;• Add a course (only offered courses, once, at most 18 units per quarter) and remove one&lt;br&gt;• Mark a course completed or planned&lt;br&gt;• Count units planned, completed and remaining out of 175&lt;br&gt;• Warn when a course is placed before its prerequisites&lt;br&gt;• Report which requirements are met by planned courses or by completed courses only&lt;br&gt;• Convert to and from rows for the API&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;&quot;&gt;Course&lt;br&gt;DegreeRequirement&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="372" width="380" height="352" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center;padding:5px;border-bottom:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;DegreeRequirement&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;&quot;&gt;src/DegreeRequirement.ts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-right:1px solid #333;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Collaborators&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;width:68%;border-right:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;• Know its description, the courses it lists, and how many are needed (count)&lt;br&gt;• Tell whether a set of courses satisfies it&lt;br&gt;• Tell how many more courses are needed and which listed courses are missing&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;&quot;&gt;Course (by code)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="372" width="380" height="208" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center;padding:5px;border-bottom:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Course&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;&quot;&gt;src/Course.ts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-right:1px solid #333;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Collaborators&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;width:68%;border-right:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;• Know its code, title, units and description&lt;br&gt;• Know its prerequisites: every group is needed, and any one course in a group meets it&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;&quot;&gt;—&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="372" width="380" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center;padding:5px;border-bottom:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Database&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;&quot;&gt;server/src/Database.cpp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-right:1px solid #333;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666;padding:3px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;&quot;&gt;Collaborators&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;width:68%;border-right:1px solid #333;&quot;&gt;• Create the SQLite tables and seed them from courses.json and requirements.json on start&lt;br&gt;• Read courses, requirements and saved plans&lt;br&gt;• Replace a plan&amp;#x27;s courses and record when it was saved&lt;br&gt;• Reject courses that aren&amp;#x27;t offered or are listed twice&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top;padding:5px 6px;&quot;&gt;— (SQLite)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1350" y="372" width="380" height="224" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="HTTP" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>